goq(){return"Open Model Management"},
gop(){return'From the full Settings page or the right-side settings panel on wide screens, open "AI Model Management" to download, update, activate, or remove local models.'},
gos(){return"Pick a model for your device"},
gor(){return"The screen automatically suggests a suitable model tier based on your device's capability (RAM, CPU cores), and lists every available variant for each role (multilingual classifier / statistical analysis / adversarial defense / report LLM)."},
gou(){return"Download & apply"},
got(){return'Tap "Download" next to the model you want and wait for it to finish \u2014 the first model you download is automatically set active. If you have multiple variants installed, tap "Set active" to switch anytime; tap the trash icon to remove a model you no longer need to free up space.'},
gow(){return"Updating a model"},
